Pacioli's schema migrations: Alembic, run through Flask-Migrate.

    .venv/bin/python manage.py db upgrade                        # apply pending revisions
    .venv/bin/python manage.py db migrate -m "change" --rev-id 0003  # draft from model changes
    .venv/bin/python manage.py db current

0001_baseline.sql freezes the schema the pre-Alembic installers built; do not
edit it. Autogenerate ignores the objects listed in
pacioli/database/migration_scope.py. See "Schema migrations" in README.md.
